          </a:p>
          <a:p>
            <a:r><a:rPr sz="1020"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="1E293B"/></a:solidFill></a:rPr>
            <a:t>â€¢ Frontend &amp; UI: Semantic HTML5, CSS3 Gov Theme, Vanilla ES6+ Modular State Engine (Zero heavyweight runtime, instant &lt;800ms load).&#10;â€¢ Cryptography &amp; Security: Native Web Crypto API (SHA-256), FIPS 180-4, RFC 3161 PKI, 256-bit TLS in transit, AES-256 at rest.&#10;â€¢ Compliance &amp; Standards: GIGW 3.0 Accessible Indian Gov Website Guidelines, ISO 27001, DPDP Act 2023.&#10;â€¢ Cloud &amp; Offline Storage: Vercel Serverless Edge, IndexedDB local encrypted cache (offline-resilient for rural police stations).</a:t></a:r>
